---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import AgentLine from '../components/AgentLine.astro';
---
<Base title="Our Story — Park Homes" active="about" desc="Why we build the way we build — Park Homes, Auckland.">

  <section style="padding-bottom:0">
    <div class="wrap">
      <p class="eyebrow">Our story</p>
      <h1 class="opener-h" style="margin:16px 0 22px">Why we build the way we build.</h1>
      <p class="lead">Park Homes began with a simple conviction — that a development should feel personal and approachable, and still leave behind buildings a neighbourhood is proud of. That belief has guided close to two decades of work across Auckland.</p>
      <hr class="rule" style="max-width:120px;background:var(--accent-2);height:2px;margin-top:34px" />
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <div class="wrap twocol" style="align-items:end">
      <div class="ph" data-label="Founder portrait — pending client photo" style="aspect-ratio:4/5;border-radius:4px"></div>
      <div>
        <h2 style="font-size:clamp(24px,3.4vw,34px)">Jason Wong</h2>
        <p class="eyebrow" style="margin:8px 0 16px">Founder &amp; Director</p>
        <p>Jason has worked in property since 2003 — starting hands-on in renovation and fit-out, then moving through do-ups and development. Park Homes is the brand he set out to build: considered, personal, and made to last.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="tint">
    <div class="wrap reading">
      <h3>The trade years</h3>
      <p>Jason’s route into property didn’t start in an office. It started on site — in renovation and the everyday craft of building. Those years on the tools shaped a developer who reads a plan the way a builder does, and who cares about the details buyers only notice years later.</p>

      <h3>Why boutique, not volume</h3>
      <p>The conviction is deliberate: Park Homes builds a refined series, not a mass-produced product. Fewer homes, done properly — intelligent layouts, honest materials, and a standard held from consent through to handover.</p>

      <p class="pquote" style="margin:34px 0">Personal, approachable homes — and landmarks a neighbourhood is proud of.</p>

      <h3>What we refuse to compromise</h3>
      <p>Quality control at every stage, delivered under a licensed building practitioner. The ambition is to keep building better places to live across Auckland — and to build a name that stands behind every one of them.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <div class="wrap">
      <p class="eyebrow sec-eyebrow">Milestones</p>
      <h2 class="sec-h" style="margin-bottom:34px">A steady line of work</h2>
      <ul class="milestones">
        <li><p class="yr">2003</p><h4>Into property</h4><p>Jason begins in property — hands-on, in renovation and fit-out.</p></li>
        <li><p class="yr">2003 – 2021</p><h4>Do-ups &amp; development</h4><p>Close to two decades across renovation, do-ups and residential development.</p></li>
        <li><p class="yr">2021</p><h4>The Park Homes Ltd</h4><p>The brand is formalised — a boutique developer with its own standard.</p></li>
        <li><p class="yr">Now</p><h4>Five developments underway</h4><p>Riverside, Howick, Castor Bay, Forrest Hill and Greenview — across Auckland.</p></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="tint">
    <div class="wrap">
      <p class="eyebrow sec-eyebrow">What we stand for</p>
      <div class="values" style="margin-top:30px">
        <div><h3>Considered design</h3><p>A series of homes, not a run of units. Planned with intent.</p></div>
        <div><h3>Rigorous quality control</h3><p>Disciplined checks at every stage, under an LBP.</p></div>
        <div><h3>Hands-on, from the ground up</h3><p>Led by a founder who started on the tools.</p></div>
      </div>
      <div class="trust" style="background:transparent;margin-top:40px">
        <div class="row">
          <span class="cred">LBP · Licensed Building Practitioner</span>
          <span class="partners">Carters · Bunnings · Akarana · CNX Construction · Ideal Housing</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="dark cta">
    <div class="wrap">
      <h2>Come and see what we’re building.</h2>
      <p>Sales enquiries are handled by our appointed agent.</p>
      <div><a class="arrow-cta" href="/contact/"><span class="circ">→</span><span class="lbl">Enquire</span></a></div>
      <div style="margin-top:16px"><a class="btn btn-ghost" href="/projects/">View our developments →</a></div>
      <AgentLine />
    </div>
  </section>

</Base>
